'''Thomas Brandon Spoon''' (born July 5, 1978) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for one season with the [[Buffalo Bills]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[North Carolina Tar Heels football|North Carolina Tar Heels]] and was selected in the fourth round of the [[2001 NFL draft]] with the 110th overall pick.<ref>{{Cite web |title=2001 NFL Draft Listing |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/years/2001/draft.htm |access-date=2023-03-18 |website=Pro-Football-Reference.com |language=en}}</ref> In his only NFL season, he was the Bills [[Starting lineup|starting]] middle linebacker.

